{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_eq_find","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_eq_find","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L96-L101","doc":"The level **is** the minimum: any confinement level equals `Nat.find`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.nonempty","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.nonempty","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L84-L94","doc":"**Existence, as a `Nonempty`.**\n\nReplaces a pre-2026-09-06 `nonempty` that constructed the junk record\n`⟨0, 1, 0, 0⟩`: that proved the *type* was inhabited, not that any braid has\na level, so `prop:confinement-level-exists` was vacuously backed. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:confinement-level-exists","label":"prop:confinement-level-exists","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level-exists.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.ofExists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.ofExists","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L74-L82","doc":"**Existence of the confinement level**, by well-ordering of `ℕ`.\n\nThe set `{ ℓ : T_w ∈ J^ℓ(q) }` is nonempty (it contains `m`, since\n`J^m = H_n`), so it has a least element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.unique","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L64-L72","doc":"**Uniqueness of the confinement level** — a theorem, not an axiom.\n\nTwo confinement levels for the same braid datum agree, by antisymmetry of\n`≤` against the two minimality witnesses. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:confinement-level-unique","label":"prop:confinement-level-unique","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level-unique.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_min","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_min","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L62-L62","doc":"and no smaller index does — this is what makes it the *minimum*. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_valid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level_valid","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L60-L60","doc":"`level` sits in the filtration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.level","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L58-L58","doc":"Confinement level `ℓ ∈ ℕ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel.mk","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel","kind":"structure","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L50-L62","doc":"**Confinement level** of a closed braid at substrate parameter `q`.\n\n`valid` is the filtration predicate `fun d ℓ => T_w(d) ∈ J^ℓ(d.q)`, carried\nas a parameter — a function of the datum — so that `level` is determined by\nthe braid rather than chosen freely alongside it. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:confinement-level","label":"def:confinement-level","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-level.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.q","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L48-L48","doc":"Substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.nStrands","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.nStrands","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Number of strands `n(K)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.braidIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.braidIndex","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The closed braid (encoded by its NF permutation index). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidDatum","kind":"structure","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementLevel.lean#L40-L48","doc":"The braid datum a confinement level is taken at: a closed braid (by its NF\npermutation index) with a strand count, at a substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0}]}